        "id": "intro-comment",
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Take the First Few\n\nStops a stream after a set number of items. Use it to cap an expensive downstream step while you tune a workflow, then remove it when you ship.\n\n**How it works:** \"1 Source list\" holds six color names. \"Fan out\" emits them one at a time, \"2 Take\" lets the first 3 through and drops the rest, and \"3 Result\" collects them. It runs locally with no model or key.\n\n**Try this:** Change n on \"2 Take\" to 1 or 5 and compare the result."
        },
